What feature?
a) remember username:  The GUI now does that
b) username from file, password from management: Mainly a limitation of
openvpn -- the ticket should be tagged OpenVPN, not OpenVPN-GUI.
c) username from file, password from GUI without supporting (b): Add
another IPC mechanism for communicating with the GUI -- COM, DataCopy, DDE,
RPC, Pipes, something else. Seriously?

